{"id": "PPS-D-019197", "model": "luna-high-focus-v3", "facts": {"v1_limits": [{"quote": "다. 급식품 공급에 필요한 시설, 냉동차량, 점포를 소유 또는 임차하고 있는 자이어야 합니다. (냉동탑차로 납품, 차량내부온도를 확인할 수 있는 온도계 비치)", "kind": "facility_equipment_staff", "private_firms_allowed": false, "statute_quote": null, "need_quote": null, "special_quote": null}], "sw_project_quote": null, "sw_provider_quote": null, "sw_floor_statement_quote": null, "sw_referenced_missing": false, "정보부족": false, "정보부족_사유": null, "sw_project_quote_원문일치": false, "sw_provider_quote_원문일치": false, "sw_floor_statement_quote_원문일치": false}, "prompt_sha256": "740bf1c46251120a83424d26922ce6300db0e9ac4a9f8aad430407fac8a2241b", "notice_sha256": "7aecfb98b9e104c02fb871bd4789780da115e5ae932291c398bf88a4dd78dc7f", "command": "api:gpt-6-luna effort=high cache=explicit-30m (tools/luna_api.py)", "elapsed_seconds": 14.659144599980209, "created_at": "2026-09-26T23:44:22.453037+00:00", "raw_sha256": "879cd680bad94b793c5cdc9be936eb211491043cc4798ade190e89d75cc6c765", "usage": {"usage": {"input_tokens": 5892, "input_tokens_details": {"cache_write_tokens": 0, "cached_tokens": 1799}, "output_tokens": 2076, "output_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1898}, "total_tokens": 7968}, "num_turns": 1, "total_cost_usd": 0.001465, "duration_ms": 14659}}
{"id": "PPS-D-006670", "model": "luna-high-focus-v3", "facts": {"v1_limits": [{"quote": "마. 차량은 계약회사 소유의 차량(지입차량 불가)이며, 자동차손해배상보장법 제5조의 규정에 의한 자동차 책임보험 또는 종합보험에 가입된 차량이어야 합니다.", "kind": "facility_equipment_staff", "private_firms_allowed": true, "statute_quote": null, "need_quote": "학교별 운행노선에 따른 등·하교 및 그 외 교육활동", "special_quote": null}], "sw_project_quote": null, "sw_provider_quote": null, "sw_floor_statement_quote": null, "sw_referenced_missing": false, "정보부족": false, "정보부족_사유": null, "sw_project_quote_원문일치": false, "sw_provider_quote_원문일치": false, "sw_floor_statement_quote_원문일치": false}, "prompt_sha256": "740bf1c46251120a83424d26922ce6300db0e9ac4a9f8aad430407fac8a2241b", "notice_sha256": "2419434b0b9ea220b7223e27c6cdc4bca8e2fe67e72f42a94cff2366d5cc2c34", "command": "api:gpt-6-luna effort=high cache=explicit-30m (tools/luna_api.py)", "elapsed_seconds": 15.720735399983823, "created_at": "2026-09-26T23:44:38.179598+00:00", "raw_sha256": "c954c1bf366df3ef23480aa219b4e2720702bb6927ed3f938a0ce875daf77ec5", "usage": {"usage": {"input_tokens": 6734, "input_tokens_details": {"cache_write_tokens": 0, "cached_tokens": 1799}, "output_tokens": 2107, "output_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1917}, "total_tokens": 8841}, "num_turns": 1, "total_cost_usd": 0.001565, "duration_ms": 15720}}
